rows={
25:('All156 candidate lines read: multiset sorting, fresh token generation, replay application, structure flag, labels and tests.','Delta is an unchecked Vec alias; callers must canonicalize and validate it. NewDatum naming avoids existing-token designation by apostrophe suffix and tracks names within delta. Pure replay refuses without mutating base, but resource usage and n+1 overflow are not typed errors. Menu origin is not enforced by the type.'),
23:('Complete204 bounds lines read, with exact85+26-line template transfer.','Bounds limits max_items<=2 but not max_arity or state size. DeclaredSpace product validates a separate positive-arity convention and checked multiplication; pair_slots is a declared product, not actual candidate count. Scope metadata alone does not implement bounded work.'),
44:('All200 measure lines read, with exact85+26-line template transfer.','mu1 item count and mu2 lexicographic arity refinement are declared choices, not unique mathematical necessities. usize-as-i64 and unchecked sum can violate positive arity cost on large public inputs; sentinel-1 does not prevent comparing different measures through common tuple type. Small tests are source only.'),
58:('Full367 response lines read, including all nonmatching reformatted wrapper/test code without elision.','Private immutable NodeView keeps cache tied to base and rejects ruled bases; profile additions first validate replay, then enumerate new contexts. Fast and naive checks preserve all explicit requirements and validate target; fast false combines malformed input with unsuccessful separation. Whole small initial populations are test source, not fresh replay or all-state adequacy.'),
33:('Complete343 enumeration lines reviewed with exact85+26-line template reconstruction.','Finite cost0..2 reference and pruned shapes are concrete; positive arity and index checks come from apply_delta. Pruned completeness needs target/prior-obligation invariants not checked here; an already-separated target with two unsatisfied other pairs gives omitted valid repairs. Direct public functions do not enforce bounds.max_items and cost>2 panics; arity work remains exponential.'),
46:('All363 minima lines reviewed with exact85+26-line template reconstruction.','Keeps every best-cost delta and child-key classes with multiplicity; item-first search is appropriate for both named measures. Public MinResponses fields can forge cost/scope/member claims; try_quotient only propagates isomorphism-budget errors and can panic on invalid delta. None completeness depends on pruning premises and positive cost encoding, not merely Bounds metadata.'),
60:('Complete249 role classifier/label/test lines reviewed with exact85+26-line template reconstruction.','Shape labels are descriptive, not derived authorization or semantic validity: is_supply overrides any delta, innovation shape need not reference its new form, and auxiliary shape need not use its new datum unless upstream constraints hold. Labels omit form/argument identities and must not serve as certificate keys.'),
30:('All221 closure policy lines reviewed with exact85+26-line template reconstruction.','Correctly separates external demand policy from object-language derivation and explicitly restricts n-choose2 progress to fixed data and successful responses preserving previous requirements. Orbits equivariant, least representative labels not generally. Public round-bound multiplication can overflow even when final divided answer fits; no universal termination without feasibility/resource premises.')}
